.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH stool-dotfile-migrate 1  "stool-dotfile-migrate "
.SH NAME
stool\-dotfile\-migrate \- Explicitly copy legacy xyrev state into stool without deploying files
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstool\-dotfile\-migrate\fR [\fB\-\-from\fR] [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Explicitly copy legacy xyrev state into stool without deploying files
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-from\fR \fI<FROM>\fR
Previous control directory (defaults to ~/.xyrev/dotfile)
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Inspect the migration without writing files or running hooks
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
